# Brickadia workspace handoff (read this first, don't re-derive)

**BUILDING RULES:** `BUILDING.md` holds the game's geometry rules (grid, sizes, overlap, shapes, the owner's looks norms, player/bike limits, quirks, open questions). Read it before generating bricks; add new rules there.

**SMASHABLE POTS (2026-10-06, LIVE, owner: "make a pot you can smash"):** prefabs `pot` (B_Jar, Component_Interact prompt "Smash", ConsoleTag "event:pot") and `pot_shards` from server `bridge/tools/potgen.mjs` (both centred on their origin: pot loads at ground+12, shards at ground+2). Plugin `omegga-pots/` -> server `plugins/pots/`: on Omegga's `interact` with message event:pot it ClearRegions the jar, loads pot_shards + a coin (coin1 55% / coin10 15% / coin25 3%), clears the shards by exact boxes after 8 s and reloads the pot after 90 s (pending respawns kept in the plugin store). `!pot` (host + config placers) drops a pot at your feet. mapgen places pots in ruins (house corners, round the well) and goblin camps where the site builder is free -> out/pots.json (35 live; stamp with br.Prefab.Load "pot" x y z 0 16 after a full reload). Test without a player: bridge op {op:'emit', event:'interact', args:[{player:{name:'t'}, position:[x,y,z], message:'event:pot'}]}.

**SIGNS (2026-10-06, LIVE, owner: "town signs"):** ruins.mjs `buildSign` = post + two back-to-back plank boards with `Component_TextDisplay` (the shop price display's settings; Face 4 = local +Z, base orientation direction 3 / rotation 1 turned about Z per facing). "Lumbrick" (mapgen `TOWN_NAME`) outside the 4 gates; each hamlet `placeName(seed)` + "<tiers> smiths" where its road comes in (`v.entry` = the joined spoke); "Ruins of <name>" at the ruins (shorter post). 18 signs, 34/36 boards live. TRAP: component fields that are asset references (TextDisplay `Font`) are INDEXES into the load's external asset table: chunk ops now carry `externalAssets: [{ type: 'BrickFontDescriptor', name: 'MonaspaceXenon' }]` (ruins.mjs EXTERNAL_ASSETS) and the bridge passes it to writeBrzLegacy(save, { externalAssets }) (bridge omegga.main.js patched, old .pre_assets). Any full loader that merges chunks must pass externalAssets too.

