- Terrain smoothing: every 1-`MAX_RISE` (6) brick step gets a micro wedge/corner as tall as the step (added live 2026-10-02 as a 12,606-piece delta; trees/boulders were left as they were). `--smooth ramp` swaps straight-slope wedges for upright PB_DefaultMicroRamp (rotation 0 rises toward -x); the owner tried it and preferred the wedges, so the default is `wedge`. Notch fallbacks (2026-10-02, loaded live as a 26,269-piece delta): 3 higher sides -> wedge toward the middle one, 2 adjacent -> outer corner, 1 higher (not exactly k) -> wedge, pits/ditches -> flat fill brick. Tidy cases fall through to the notch rules (fixed 2026-10-02, +45,522 pieces live); `--gaps` counts cells still unsmoothed (~450 cliffs >6). `--probe x,y` prints the height grid round a world point.
